                <pb facs="1556" n="1544" xml:id="pg1544"/>

                <head>Participation of the United States in international scientific meetings</head>
                <p>[For summaries of the meetings of the Executive Committee of the International
                    Council of Scientific Unions (held at London, December 4–5, 1945) and of the
                    International Union of Geodesy and Geophysics (Oxford, December 10–14, 1945),
                    see Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Participation of the United
                        States Government in International Conferences, July 1, 1946–June 30,
                        1946</hi>, pages 155–158.]</p>
            </div>
